{"parse":{"title":"个性/逆神者","pageid":9008,"revid":22097,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E9%80%86%E7%A5%9E%E8%80%85&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E9%80%86%E7%A5%9E%E8%80%85&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E9%80%86%E7%A5%9E%E8%80%85&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>逆神者</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E9.80.86.E7.A5.9E.E8.80.85\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"逆神者\"><b>逆神者</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">个性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"个性 逆神者.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/90/ba0ay8hwxy5ut691xeah83opep3gucn.png/80px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E9%80%86%E7%A5%9E%E8%80%85.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/90/ba0ay8hwxy5ut691xeah83opep3gucn.png/120px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E9%80%86%E7%A5%9E%E8%80%85.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/90/ba0ay8hwxy5ut691xeah83opep3gucn.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />逆神者\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">散播质疑</font></span>]，及[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"逆神者\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">逆神者</font></span></span>]效果。攻击时，对目标施加随机<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"2级减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">2级减益</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。<br />✦行动结束时，对每个拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"质疑之种\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">质疑之种</font></span></span>]目标的进行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"警戒\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">警戒</font></span></span>]（警戒中心会随目标移动），触发时：对目标施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"蛊惑\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">蛊惑</font></span></span>]，并对所有处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"质疑之种\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">质疑之种</font></span></span>]警戒范围内拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"蛊惑\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">蛊惑</font></span></span>]的敌人造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">40%</font>魔攻值的穿透范围伤害（该警戒无法被打断），警戒每回合最多触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次。<br />✦攻防属性提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">5%</font>。<br />✦行动开始时，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增加<font color=\"#58cb48\">20</font>点。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%AE%89%E7%BC%87%E6%AD%8C\" title=\"角色图鉴库/安缇歌\"><img alt=\"头像 安缇歌.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/f5/nunxl1yam533nc8bpjrxwma6hxkbsf3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">安缇歌</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">散播质疑</font></span>]，及[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"逆神者\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">逆神者</font></span></span>]效果。攻击时，对目标施加随机<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"2级减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">2级减益</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。<br />✦行动结束时，对每个拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"质疑之种\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">质疑之种</font></span></span>]目标的进行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"警戒\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">警戒</font></span></span>]（警戒中心会随目标移动），触发时：对目标施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"蛊惑\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">蛊惑</font></span></span>]，并对所有处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"质疑之种\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">质疑之种</font></span></span>]警戒范围内拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"蛊惑\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">蛊惑</font></span></span>]的敌人造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">40%</font>魔攻值的穿透范围伤害（该警戒无法被打断），警戒每回合最多触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次。<br />✦攻防属性提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>。<br />✦行动开始时，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]增加<font color=\"#58cb48\">25</font>点。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%